      '資料來源：各捷運公司與交通部 TDX 官方時刻表。支援的路網在營運時段依官方即時資訊校正；部分路線無逐班時刻，以官方班距推算。': 'Sources: official metro operators and TDX timetables. Supported systems use official live corrections during service hours; routes without per-train timetables are estimated from official headways.',
